codex
Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Fresh builds and all five positive claims reached `#Top`, but a proof-local rule was demonstrably unsound: it ignored the actual falsey return value and selected the opposite branch. The proof also uses manually substituted closures instead of executing the submitted `solution.mpy`.

The Python implementation itself passed 70,012 differential cases, and the ground non-vacuity mutation failed correctly.

